<title>USA: HealthSouth Q4 net income rises.</title>
<headline>HealthSouth Q4 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.41		    $0.31</p>
<p> Income	    69,431		   51,461</p>
<p> Revs		642,771		  533,097</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  166,390		  161,864</p>
<p>			     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.49		    $1.08</p>
<p> Income	    249,207		  162,995</p>
<p> Revs		2,436,537		2,003,146</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  163,145		  148,730</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net and shr exclude non-recurring expenses for 1996 acquisitions, a total of $7 million for the quarter and $28 million for the year.</p>
<p>Full company name is HealthSouth Corp.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
